  ],
  "notes": [
    "This is a static site; pages load their CDN dependencies directly and are not bundled through npm.",
    "Multiple exact dependency versions are intentionally retained because older and newer games use different APIs.",
    "weather.html references the unversioned https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js endpoint; it is cached by its exact URL for offline fallback but remains a floating CDN reference in that HTML file.",
    "The arcade loads Ruffle from an unversioned unpkg.com URL; the pinned 0.6.0 copy is also retained in the dependency inventory and precache list."
  ]
}
